camera_aunit



camera_aunit command line options:
    -1 <trace options>            : Camera Lib unit test            (Camera.Lib.Unit_Test)
    -2 <trace options>            : Camera Lib Debug                (Camera Lib)
    -?                            : this message                    (Ada_Lib)
    -a <trace options>            : Ada_Lib library trace options   (Ada_Lib)
    -d <directory>                : current directory               (Video Lib)
    -e <routine>                  : routine to test.                (test_ada_lib)
    -g <trace options>            : GNOGA Unit Test traces          (Ada_Lib.GNOGA)
    -G <trace options>            : GNOGA traces                    (GNOGA library)
    -h                            : this message                    (Ada_Lib)
    -P                            : pause                           (Ada_Lib)
    -r                            : remote camera                   (Video Lib)
    -s <suite to test>            : select test suite to run.       (test_ada_lib)
    -s                            : simulate camera                 (Video Lib)
    -t <trace options>            : ada_lib trace options           (Ada_Lib Unit Test)
    -u <<TRACE OPTIONS>>          : trace flags.                    (Ada_Lib.GNOGA)
    -U <unit test trace Ada_Lib>  : select trace                    (test_ada_lib)
    -v                            : verbose                         (Ada_Lib)
    -V <trace options>            : trace options                   (Video Lib)
    -w <port number>              : Web server port                 (GNOGA library)
    -x                            : exit on tests complete          (test_ada_lib)
    -@A <suites>                  : enable default disabled suites. (test_ada_lib)
    -@c                           : trace test condition            (Ada_Lib)
    -@d                           : driver suites                   (test_ada_lib)
    -@i                           : indent trace                    (Ada_Lib)
    -@l                           : List test suites                (test_ada_lib)
    -@m                           : manual operations.              (test_ada_lib)
    -@n <number of random seeds>  : number seeds.                   (test_ada_lib)
    -@p                           : include program in trace        (Ada_Lib)
    -@P                           : Print test suites.              (test_ada_lib)
    -@R <seed>                    : set random seed                 (test_ada_lib)
    -@S                           : report random seed              (test_ada_lib)
    -@T                           : include task in trace           (Ada_Lib)
    -@u                           : use random seed                 (test_ada_lib)
    -@x                           : exclude time in trace           (Ada_Lib)


Camera Lib trace options (-2)
      a               all
      b               Base.debug
      B               Camera.Lib.Base.debug
      c               camera configuration
      C               camera commands
      d               camera Debug
      g               Widgets.Generic_Table
      l               camera Library
      L               camera library options
      m               Camera.Main.Debug
      s               Camera.State.Debug
      S               Camera.States.Debug
      V               Trace Video widgets
      #a              Adjust Window
      #c              Widgets.Control debyg
      #C              Widgets.Configured debug
      #l              List camera commands
      #p              Configuration.Camera.Setup.Debug
      #s              Configuration
      #S              Configuration.Camera.State.Debug

Video Lib trace options (-V)
      a               all
      d               Debug_Option
      s               configuration.state.Debug
Camera Lib Unit Test trace options -(1)
      a               all
      A               Widgets.Adjust unit test trace
      b               Base Command_Tests
      B               Base Test
      c               Widgets.Control unit_test trace
      d               Camera.Lib.Unit_Test.Debug
      m               main unit test trace
      o               unit_test options
      p               program trace
      q               camera queue
      s               Configuration.Camera.State unit_test options
      S               Configuration.Camera.Setup unit_test options
      t               unit_test trace
      #c              Camera Command trace

